The MariaDB plugin never aborts on a degraded engine: a write that degrades
it fails the statement, and every later write fails until mariadbd restarts.
Reverts #294. The guard is in mariadb_proof_tests (bytecaskdb-mariadb-plugin).
Guarded-by: "prove_plugin__single_insert__pk_only__autocommit__ENGINE_DEGRADED"

